      ],
      "text": "Trigger The dragon rolls initiative\n\n---\nEffect The dragon affects all enemies it can see within 60 feet with Calm heightened to half the dragon's level rounded up (DC 42 Will save). The dragon doesn't need to Sustain this effect, but if the dragon takes any hostile action against those affected, it breaks the effect for all creatures.",
